  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vaccine Demand and Confidence: Sustaining the expansion of the Overseas Health Assessment and Management of U.S. - Bound Refugees, Non-Immigrant Visa Applicants and other Migrant Populations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall aim of the vaccine demand and confidence project is to increase COVID-19 vaccine confidence, demand, and uptake among selected urban and camp refugee populations. The project is being implemented in three (3) regions: Africa, Europe and Asia. The International Organization for Migration (IOM), will provide in-country oversight and management for the project, including leading training, assessment, intervention, and monitoring/evaluation activities.</narrative>
  </description>
